\cf1\\fs20 Council convened a closed session at 6:03 PM in the Council Conference Room to discuss the character, professional competence, or physical or mental health of an individual. The Council meeting adjourned immediately following the closed session.\\par\r\n\\par\r\n\\par\r\n\\par\r\n\\par\r\nCS, BD - roll call vote 6 - 0\\par\r\n\\par\r\ncharager , meeting in city hall.\\par\r\n\\par\r\n}\r\n","EventItemActionId":383,"EventItemActionName":"approved","EventItemActionText":"A motion was made by Cyndi Sharkey, seconded by Brooke D'Sousa to convene a closed session to discuss the character, professional competence, or physical or mental health of an individual and adjourn the Council meeting immediately following the closed session...The motion carried by the following roll call vote:","EventItemPassedFlag":1,"EventItemPassedFlagName":"Pass","EventItemRollCallFlag":0,"EventItemFlagExtra":0,"EventItemTitle":"Possible Closed Session: character, professional competence, or physical or mental health of an individual.","EventItemTally":null,"EventItemAccelaRecordId":null,"EventItemConsent":0,"EventItemMoverId":null,"EventItemMover":null,"EventItemSeconderId":null,"EventItemSeconder":null,"EventItemMatterId":6975,"EventItemMatterGuid":"A7ED7EB4-FB75-433C-92A4-CC9F3FB32FBD","EventItemMatterFile":"26-446","EventItemMatterName":null,"EventItemMatterType":"Resolution","EventItemMatterStatus":"Passed","EventItemMatterAttachments":[]},{"EventItemId":44392,"EventItemGuid":"24E4EA7A-C31A-4B14-8A8A-187E40D7D84F","EventItemLastModifiedUtc":"2026-09-30T23:33:03.033","EventItemRowVersion":"AAAAAAB15Jc=","EventItemEventId":2090,"EventItemAgendaSequence":12,"EventItemMinutesSequence":8,"EventItemAgendaNumber":"2.","EventItemVideo":106238,"EventItemVideoIndex":967,"EventItemVersion":"1","EventItemAgendaNote":null,"EventItemMinutesNote":"{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\deff0\\deflang1033{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\fnil\\fcharset0 Arial;}}\r\n{\\colortbl ;\\red0\\green0\\blue0;}\r\n\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\cf1\\fs20 Lynn Pace, City Attorney, presented information on the Centennial Parkway Street Dedication. In 2021, the City Council adopted Ordinance 21-34 modifying the street map of Sandy by vacating a portion of Centennial Parkway between 10200 South and the Mall Ring Road. The purpose of the street vacation was to accommodate a proposed project by Ron Raddon. The new and revised project will no longer include that portion of Centennial Parkway. Since the public roadway had previously been vacated, the City Council will need to re-dedicate that portion of the roadway in order to maintain that property as a public street. This is an information item and will come back to the Council for consideration at a future meeting.\\par\r\n}\r\n","EventItemActionId":null,"EventItemActionName":null,"EventItemActionText":null,"EventItemPassedFlag":null,"EventItemPassedFlagName":null,"EventItemRollCallFlag":0,"EventItemFlagExtra":0,"EventItemTitle":"Information on the Centennial Parkway Street Dedication","EventItemTally":null,"EventItemAccelaRecordId":null,"EventItemConsent":0,"EventItemMoverId":null,"EventItemMover":null,"EventItemSeconderId":null,"EventItemSeconder":null,"EventItemMatterId":6982,"EventItemMatterGuid":"4FC2E251-F632-42B5-B2E8-2D36EA3FE2B6","EventItemMatterFile":"26-453","EventItemMatterName":null,"EventItemMatterType":"Informational Report","EventItemMatterStatus":"Agenda Ready","EventItemMatterAttachments":[{"MatterAttachmentId":12827,"MatterAttachmentGuid":"8FF8A5A8-5F9E-436E-A5ED-121D650A4EAE","MatterAttachmentLastModifiedUtc":"2026-09-25T16:15:39.813","MatterAttachmentRowVersion":"AAAAAAB12NI=","MatterAttachmentName":"Centennial Parkway Dedication Memo","MatterAttachmentHyperlink":"https://sandyutah.legistar1.com/sandyutah/attachments/11d0d0d8-d8c6-451e-a187-77623799c13a.docx","MatterAttachmentFileName":"11d0d0d8-d8c6-451e-a187-77623799c13a.docx","MatterAttachmentMatterVersion":"0","MatterAttachmentIsHyperlink":false,"MatterAttachmentBinary":null,"Mat