\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\deff0\\deflang1033{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\fnil\\fcharset0 Arial;}}\r\n{\\colortbl ;\\red0\\green0\\blue0;}\r\n\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\cf1\\fs20 Council Member Cyndi Sharkey- Delta Center Tour. Amazing what they have undertaken and appreciate the invitation from SEG. Attended the Listening Tour - sponsored by the House legislators. Attended to hear what our residents were interested in. Concer: Traffic congestion on 13th east, affordable housing, data centers, flock cameras. Attended the 70th Anniversary of BD in Sandy City. Giant global company. Market leader by sizable amount in medical device manufacturing. Low profile company. Appreciated the city for showing up for today's event.  Employees from 20 to 53 years at the company. Many family members work there together. Extended our congratulations to the company.\\par\r\n\\par\r\nBC - Fall musical starts this week. Tuck Everlasting. Community invited.\\par\r\n\\par\r\nMarci HOuseman - board meeting WFWRD. Sandy and our bulk waste program - was the discussion at the board meeting. Exploring starting a bulk waste program. Save 683K by moving to bulk waste from a dumpster program. projected savings. They see the value in the program. \\par\r\n\\par\r\nAlison Stroud - appreciated Public Works responsiveness to a resident's concern. Sent in Sunday night to PW - rec'd emails back first thing on Monday morning. Resident was so appreciative. Thanked PW staff. \\par\r\n\\par\r\nAaron Dekeyzer - PUAB meeting update. Great group. Conservation is going great update plan every five years. Increased rates are going to be looked at.\\par\r\n}\r\n","EventItemActionId":null,"EventItemActionName":null,"EventItemActionText":null,"EventItemPassedFlag":null,"EventItemPassedFlagName":null,"EventItemRollCallFlag":0,"EventItemFlagExtra":0,"EventItemTitle":"Council Member Business","EventItemTally":null,"EventItemAccelaRecordId":null,"EventItemConsent":0,"EventItemMoverId":null,"EventItemMover":null,"EventItemSeconderId":null